        "product_BjnZ39uNj5f6IHE9": "lio®-minty-complete-1",
        "text_vvpZQr3MzWKgF8G4": "<h3>Mint Compleet</h3>",
        "text_4Zi3SYyagw67p5LU": "<p>60 Dagen Mint Cores</p>",
        "text_5zi0dQFup7fyRHpv": "<p>Bespaar</p>",
        "product_g8EIcSDekCFXLEPv": "lio®-minty-complete",
        "text_h4PzYaURhrh3UUg2": "<h3>Fruit Compleet</h3>",
        "text_EDezFqMclnaNXP4k": "<p>60 Dagen Fruit Cores</p>",
        "text_Wzv9YGsKNq9WKWJw": "<p>Bespaar</p>",
        "text_l7NBMJdP7RLcOExb": "<p>Niet gestopt binnen 30 dagen? Geld terug!</p>",
        "text_EzdS4Jw0B3WhBYNe": "<h3><strong>Gratis verzending</strong></h3>",
        "text_Hw23gPbUjuaHEQV4": "<h3><strong>Levering</strong></h3>",
        "text_17jdk2vruL5REh6s": "<p><strong>Safe & Secure Payments</strong></p>",
        "text_zT2czcMZC0FgS2eK": "<p><strong>40% of people also add:</strong></p>",
        "product_Ox6bno9sYla78J6l": "lio®-complete",
        "text_QXGXy6RRpWuHwFbf": "<h3>Classic Complete </h3>",
        "text_kWKRLmLTSiuSJjpk": "<p>60 days of Flavour Cores</p>",
        "product_uSUShiN3yWUVPp06": "lio®-diffuser",
        "text_D2ZIpkXIjgrOoQKv": "<h3>Classic Olive </h3>",
        "text_I7GVzqcNRrCoE7LN": "<p>Premium Olive Wood</p>",
        "product_p7NEviBXbyuMoiwS": "lio®-diffuser",
        "text_juqkyqFtbPjhqE9P": "<h3>Classic Walnut </h3>",
        "text_5p2JlLYu4dI1tMVi": "<p>Premium Walnut Wood</p>",
        "text_xdVbEDmquprjA7E7": "<h3>Any Questions?</h3>",
        "text_fFndBUgtgGlNrzLr": "<h3>We've got answers</h3>",
        "text_gwW6sLMMkhWzNSHW": "<p><strong>What does flavoured air taste like?</strong></p>",
        "text_WAQfMVcmveGHeK8c": "<p>Lio’s flavoured air provides a subtle, natural taste designed to help you quit smoking or vaping. </p><p></p><p>It’s less intense than vapor but refreshing, similar to a lightly infused herbal tea or soda without the sweetness.</p>",
        "text_nYCe3Sls4l9cBEAY": "<p><strong>How does Lio work?</strong></p>",
        "text_Yc42YBqzFEyTWnKr": "<p>Lio offers nicotine-free, naturally flavored air to help you quit bad habits effortlessly. 100% natural and 90% cheaper than smoking, it keeps the hand-to-mouth habit for an easy transition. </p><p></p><p>Trusted by 50,000+ customers and backed by a 30-day money-back guarantee, it’s the easiest choice for a healthier life.</p>",
        "text_llqszrYVaxRSIrs8": "<p><strong>Shipping & Refunds</strong></p>",
        "text_sgfMClmiE7KXCrst": "<p>We ship worldwide for free from the Netherlands!</p><p></p><p>Delivery takes <strong>2-3 days within Europe</strong>, <strong>3-4 days to the UK</strong>, <strong>4-8 days outside Europe</strong>, and <strong>next-day delivery in the Middle East</strong> (from Dubai). </p><p></p><p>Enjoy fast, reliable shipping at no extra cost.</p>",
        "text_alzRp4UTpcE1PFSv": "<p><strong>Money Back Guarantee</strong></p>",
        "text_gflUVT0g8jg2punc": "<p>If you’ve used Lio™, commit to a 30 days to experience its benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you’re not satisfied. This ensures you have enough time to fully explore its impact before making a decision.</p>",
        "text_adtPPvHcdghj6118": "<p><strong>How To Use Lio? </strong></p>",
        "text_SyDYt4z5dHjXFXtP": "<p><strong>Using Your Lio Is Simple—Just 3 Steps</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Fray</strong> your preferred flavour core.</li><li><strong>Slide</strong> the core into the Lio.</li><li><strong>Relief</strong> your cravings.</li></ol>",
        "text_fwBsy3wT6mjVkIyh": "<p><strong>Is Lio safe?</strong></p>",
        "text_0cDFLjnsNQm2l1ve": "<p><strong>Absolutely!</strong> Lio is made from 100% natural ingredients, including essential oils, plant extracts, and natural flavors. It’s completely free of nicotine, chemicals, or harmful toxins, making it a safe, clean alternative to smoking and vaping.</p>",
        "text_yIwOcWI297v8lj2s": "<p><strong>How long do Flavour Cores last?</strong></p>",
        "text_cXHc6VZ7SHOTyLke": "<p>Each Flavour Core is designed to last up to <strong>2 to 3 days</strong> with regular use, depending on how often you use your Lio. A pack of six cores provides enough flavour for <strong>60 days</strong>.</p>",
        "text_0YIcqEmMfKLTYlwT": "<p><strong>How often can I use Lio?</strong></p>",
        "text_qE7U6yrinevehUDO": "<p>You can use Lio as often as you like. It’s completely natural and free of nicotine, smoke, or vapor, so there’s no harm in frequent use.</p>",
        "text_G6YSL9iFK4Zcaeql": "<p>Bestelling vandaag nog verzonden?</p>",
        "text_DaF7n41I6D2O8jth": "<p>Bestel binnen:</p>",
        "text_Yp19wE9VbYHJVCbV": "<p>Uur</p>",
        "text_Kb80v9BpsNx4ZQOj": "<p>Minuten</p>",
        "text_nXS8iHQsVDlO9BtV": "<p>Seconden</p>",
        "text_QHYOuipDyIaDi431": "<p>BEVRIJD JEZELF</p>",
        "text_TMCTQ6uJPeQbNtnW": "<p>van nicotine, damp, rook en gifstoffen.</p>",
        "text_eXCSllSgzkMuktEh": "<p>BEVRIJD JEZELF</p>",
        "text_qgSg5GNZFCwzjBSC": "<p>van nicotine, damp, rook en gifstoffen.</p>",
        "text_g3LHxfgEbb6dLuBx": "<p>Meer dan 50.000 succesverhalen</p>",
        "text_dLIFLx5L4DV6217d": "<p>Met een succespercentage van 92% is Lio 2,5x effectiever dan andere methoden.</p>",
        "text_AE8Z4qFbl79VAPcI": "<p>Werkt het niet? Geld terug.</p>",
        "text_edAOSiHMuCjvzR6V": "<p>Wij hebben zoveel vertrouwen in Lio, dat als het niet werkt, u uw geld terugkrijgt.</p>",
        "text_SrCUAmX5OfuzVqup": "<p>100% natuurlijk en chemicaliënvrij</p>",
        "text_ZxE30LkYTqaWmid6": "<p>Een geheel natuurlijke manier om de hunkering naar een sigaret te onderdrukken, zonder rook, damp of nicotine.</p>",
        "text_sBzBZSoIcfDCe5Vs": "<p>90% goedkoper dan uw slechte gewoonte</p>",
        "text_ibAB9bvMGnzLIRSN": "<p>Uw portemonnee zal u dankbaar zijn. Bespaar duizenden euro's per jaar terwijl u geniet van de vrijheid.</p>",
        "text_1rX1G1rM9rPgAVF9": "<p>Niet gestopt binnen 30 dagen? Geld terug!</p>",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "instant_t_t_qfw_aovphd3v_b2_d_tEYfLQ": {
      "type": "instant-tTQfwAovphd3vB2D",
      "settings": {
        "text_1JZBYpMKzBaeS4o2": "<p>50.000+  Tevreden Klanten</p>",
        "text_7U14WqRlIshnnNUF": "<p>4.5</p>",
        "text_JXIiSgAw8lXP3m4x": "<h3>Duizenden</h3>",
        "text_aChtnDl8udHDGpFY": "<h3>Succes verhalen</h3>",
        "text_P44O32XQn1CnhtvO": "<h3>duizenden</h3>",
        "text_RFp81ERyPR8EiORp": "<h3>succes</h3>",
        "text_kQeQ5TSevSlqwBFa": "<h3>verhalen</h3>",
        "text_8NO8AgRL0tbsnoMZ": "<p>Lio heeft mijn leven veranderd. Het geeft me rust en een gezonde, ontspannende gewoonte. Ik ben superblij en raad het iedereen aan!</p>",
        "text_maQrBu521n7mbd3n": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_1eFV81zvLhvvJcfl": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_wRLAj4SSdOWCVayk": "<p>— Martin</p>",
        "text_dvOuNbKX7qlKe5iB": "<p>Eerst was ik sceptisch, maar al snel werd ik fan. Ik neem het overal mee naartoe; het voelt als een slechte gewoonte, maar dan zonder de nadelen. Echt een aanrader!</p>",
        "text_0IBvZ3B0Kg2b4WJu": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_MYUr1p9iKdAhFDKJ": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_ybKTyknOB41RhwIP": "<p>— Rick</p>",
        "text_yMbOXv1rLZRirzoJ": "<p>Dit product helpt me enorm. Sinds ik het gebruik, rook ik veel minder. Het vervangt roken moeiteloos zonder iets te missen. Absoluut een aanrader!</p>",
        "text_MdsqTmQDVehxfTTw": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_GUNhCqlc4XnQ1itK": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_9kpWxQkOpYWJ7Gsr": "<p>— Anton</p>",
        "text_CgLnziZKPqm1jUWY": "<p>Lio is de meest effectieve manier om te stoppen met roken.Het geeft zelfs datzelfde ijzige gevoel als een vape. Geweldig!</p>",
        "text_K0Q0DYDUCUUm91D5": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_JSbPkQ5YZ81AMQ4N": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_9BiakumvopsLpp04": "<p>— Peter</p>",
        "text_KXkaMCF55AMfsqPz": "<p>\"It's insane—this stuff really helps. I'm really, really satisfied with it.\"</p><p></p><p></p>",
        "text_4VYV2Jx3AxbnwIQB": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_YB97js3Liy0H2DJg": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_PtclGQZ8Izm1jDQ8": "<p>— James Walker</p>",
        "text_oaWXxxhB6ztsh8Hi": "<p>\"I'm positively surprised by this. I haven't craved my bad habit for the past two weeks.\"</p><p></p>",
        "text_2yp35iNuXojF7O6A": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_VDdPzV5APAQnl8JW": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_6D4aRbkD3etf2Crh": "<p>— Fahad Al Mansouri</p>",
        "text_5Evg28a0wXGJelV5": "<p>\"I've been vaping for 6 to 7 years, and nothing has helped as much as Lio. It gives the same feeling.\"</p><p></p>",
        "text_ZDczXkx3DOFtTkRl": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_NEN57ZJSnlg5ckm7": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_MOLX1GMr4pVGLWrL": "<p>— Omar Khalid</p>",
        "text_5cZDX5rE87IpOe0n": "<p>\"I'm very thankful that such a product actually exists. It has finally helped me quit.\"</p>",
        "text_ctbxgmvxZ08Ha7HL": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_wP3ga2jMRMoYJvdN": "<p>Geverifieerd</p>",
        "text_8kyqJQh2oskyl33b": "<p>— Nour Al-Din</p>",
        "url_smimuLOYQUvc6lSk": "#iQOzOcy59IDcgCklf",
        "text_fskNRrcsWFlKlioJ": "<p>Bestel Nu</p>",
        "text_mz94jNHDCT3qqh1U": "<p>30-Dagen Geld-Terug-Garantie</p>",
        "text_2LZL771KpPUH5jb2": "<h3>'s Werelds eerste</h3>",
        "text_oydg7Op9ThQ8ptyO": "<h3>Smaakvolle</h3>",
        "text_4PNyrii7rEAZNmrA": "<h3>Lucht DIFFUSER</h3>",
        "text_i9U22NZDpXsJMhwu": "<h3>'s Werelds eerste</h3>",
        "text_rQ8GT6P2fYYA3M4q": "<h3>smaakvolle</h3>",
        "text_eDiIgRi37hU43cif": "<h3>lucht diffuser</h3>",
        "text_OICnV35VOygoQUeu": "<h3>100% Natuurlijk</h3>",
        "text_jrPWk6Y9cEvkSwtT": "<h3>100% natuurlijke smaken die de orale fixatie bevredigen</h3>",
        "text_y41d6jktt7GqCOPN": "<h3>Behoud de gewoonte</h3>",
        "text_Rq5pbBPfnbyO2Fq0": "<h3>Imiteert de bekende </h3><h3>hand-tot-mond gewoonte</h3>",
        "text_F6P1AjzWdYRkGGig": "<h3>90% Goedkoper</h3>",
        "text_FEGDuOxgNlwV8YTy": "<h3>Bespaar duizenden </h3><h3>Euro's per jaar</h3><h3></h3>",
        "text_ZrHvycdWqXD8D9Iq": "<h3>Overal te gebruiken</h3>",
        "text_Ftw8DbsEvIJmnnRi": "<h3>Geen rook, te gebruiken </h3><h3>waar u maar wilt.</h3>",
        "url_v4JMGJtyKnBEmeds": "#iQOzOcy59IDcgCklf",
        "text_EYicbGg6jtBUaOWU": "<p>Bestel Nu</p>",
        "text_5uYWRVzlhSEfT0TT": "<p>30-Dagen Geld-Terug-Garantie</p>",
        "text_LyX44xVsn7reKdUU": "<h3><strong>YOU ASKED</strong></h3>",
        "text_p6remupUMz6PHJPi": "<h3><strong>WE ANSWERED</strong></h3>",
        "text_WaTwKsqP2nDZ3tmy": "<p><strong>What does flavored air taste like?</strong></p>",
        "text_DKFZK101hiSCVpCv": "<p><strong>If you’re used to vapor, Lio might feel lighter at first—but it’s designed for a healthier future. Think of Lio as herbal tea compared to the sticky soda of vapor: less intense, more natural, and far better for you.</strong></p>",
        "text_arwioS7fvCBDj1hf": "<p>Can I use Lio anywhere?</p>",
        "text_dDJ0V874LTH62Lb8": "<p><strong>Yes! Lio produces no smoke, vapor, or harmful chemicals, so it can be used in most places where smoking or vaping are not allowed. Its discreet and clean design makes it a convenient, portable option to carry and use anywhere, whether you’re at home, work, or on the go.</strong></p>",
        "text_wjQzSb3ycKm6pHy9": "<p>What are cores made of?</p>",
        "text_98rlO8tG1nQrSgej": "<p>Each Core fiber is medical grade polyester, infused in the fiber is our unique plant blend of pure essential oils from amazing farms we've partnered with around the world.</p>",
        "text_prkbyJDTulvGFIIH": "<p>Is Lio safe to use?</p>",
        "text_2nMhZ1s0jU4daziH": "<p><strong>Lio is made with 100% natural ingredients and is completely free from nicotine, smoke, and harmful chemicals, making it a safe and healthier alternative for people trying to quit smoking or vaping.</strong></p>",
        "text_ul0YUeFLSAZHcrRK": "<p>How often can I use Lio?</p>",
        "text_Hn4zDVuzKYIzKhJ9": "<p><strong>Use Lio as often as you like. If you experience any discomfort, please discontinue use and consult your physician.</strong></p>",
        "text_YUv5n3LexDwhlOrh": "<p>How does Lio work?</p>",
        "text_N1E0md4cmkxg3Ria": "<p><strong>Lio works by replacing the hand-to-mouth fixation with naturally infused air, offering calming, refreshing flavors without nicotine, smoke, or chemicals. This action helps reduce the psychological need for smoking or vaping while keeping you engaged with familiar habits.</strong></p>",
        "text_DFnLroewb5eR3wH1": "<p>How long do the Lio Cores last?</p>",
        "text_pfTMfNLztxnoQDYC": "<p><strong>Each Lio Core lasts 2-4 days, depending on your usage. Heavy users may need to replace the cores more frequently, but they are designed to provide lasting flavor and a satisfying experience.</strong></p>",
        "text_hDK8Oa6IMwaYhxuQ": "<p>Shipping & Refunds</p>",
        "text_CY9rn5y5Fx3PyQvi": "<p><strong>Worldwide shipping - For Free</strong></p><p>We ship worldwide from the Netherlands with free shipping on all orders. Delivery takes 2-3 days within Europe, 4-8 days outside Europe, and next-day delivery in the Middle East (from Dubai).</p><p></p><p><strong>The Money Back Guarantee</strong></p><p>If you’ve used Lio™, commit to a 30 days to experience its benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you’re not satisfied. This ensures you have enough time to fully explore its impact before making a decision.</p>",
        "text_pAjC4dsTaVs3NuKi": "<h3>Alle heerlijke</h3>",
        "text_t6bISuIzGmPFDrft": "<h3>smaken</h3>",
        "text_RB5wnZQZyA84YLTi": "<h3>in een pack</h3>",
        "text_Z7sQ44BvNHPyq47h": "<h3>alle heerlijke</h3>",
        "text_AXJSOwVNsY7iJDWW": "<h3>smaken</h3>",
        "text_NrhzkxPHTOp2IaMO": "<h3>in een pack</h3>",
        "text_BzYeJKDWDOqs3BMS": "<h3>Verlicht hunkering</h3>",
        "text_UigDFvfh5ruwN2aq": "<h3>Speciale blends je </h3><h3>hunkering te verlichten</h3>",
        "text_sdhwXumocKU3SIDI": "<h3>3 Cores Per Zakje</h3>",
        "text_QpvTNILj6eFCoKNp": "<h3>Eén Core gaat</h3><h3>3/4 dagen mee.</h3>",
        "text_Rlo2CuF24AdGe4pv": "<h3>Géén Nicotine</h3>",
        "text_RGIhNlR6q4fBCbAn": "<h3>Een alternatief </h3><h3>om écht te stoppen.</h3>",
        "text_B2rwSHKnkD7hXuAN": "<h3>100% Veilig</h3>",
        "text_T0bHBATGmDS95xkQ": "<h3>Veilig bevonden door wetenschappers</h3>",
        "url_MTSq1SeTtBsuPMIX": "#iQOzOcy59IDcgCklf",
        "text_yO8zxV3L3OtJzjGf": "<p>Bestel Nu</p>",
        "text_ZH6SJjhwRFqN5aic": "<p>30-Dagen Geld-Terug-Garantie</p>",
        "text_FgSwCZmvZ5YPCx8P": "<h3>Wat onze klanten zeggen</h3>",
        "text_ZlhkNioNqQv2g4qO": "<p>Ontdek de ongelofelijke </p><p>succesverhalen van onze klanten.</p>",
        "text_l9ejWqok3f1uYyGJ": "<p><em>Absoluut een game-changer!</em></p>",
        "text_4cxJ2pHQ7EbehvBm": "<p>3 maanden nicotinevrij dankzij Lio! De klantenservice was uitzonderlijk. Ik ben dankbaar voor dit product op mijn reis om te stoppen met roken💪</p>",
        "text_ts8UhfiVvb6VekTJ": "<p>Sofie (5 dagen geleden)</p>",
        "text_Jci5yFGCGCi1aXis": "<p><em>Simpel en effectief!</em></p>",
        "text_kmMGp0XEQFC1PGur": "<p>Na een week Lio te hebben gebruikt, voel ik al het verschil. Geen rook, geen nicotine, gewoon iets om mijn handen bezig te houden zonder schuldgevoel. Een echte levensredder!</p>",
        "text_dMb1SFR8PB06pr7a": "<p>Zakaria Ernst (23 Nov 2024)</p>",
        "text_eUJmsrDOspmgeSzc": "<p>Een eenvoudige manier </p><p>om te stoppen</p>",
        "text_l3Quctl1aEvlL0mI": "<p>Ik gebruik dit product nu bijna een week, en wat een waanzinnig goed idee was dat. Hoewel het heel moeilijk is om te stoppen met vapen, deed dit product dat met de meeste eenvoud. Zegen jullie allemaal.</p>",
        "text_7mvxPECJvpl3BS8i": "<p>Amr (1 Oct 2024)</p>",
        "text_GjZ37hgpolp8sT3a": "<p>Ik ben gestopt na 35 jaar</p>",
        "text_B0BlXa2eDKYOjela": "<p>Nadat ik mijn collega met zijn Lio had gezien, waagde ik de sprong. Ik was al 35 jaar een roker en stoppen was een hel. Met Lio spreekt het voor zich, hoewel ik het huis niet uitga zonder.</p>",
        "text_NL7BF5zArqiQxG5f": "<p>Koen (2 May 2024)</p>",
        "text_hUN1aSX1WkZluyPA": "<p><em>Geweldig product</em></p>",
        "text_1sJLrh277s6u0VyK": "<p>74 dagen rookvrij dankzij Lio! . Dit is een fantastisch hulpmiddel voor iedereen die wil stoppen met roken. Een echte aanrader!</p>",
        "text_IdHzSt695PlNZp5k": "<p>Noëlle Huizer (17 Nov 2024)</p>",
        "text_MSAFcVyZCSqJIGh7": "<p>Helpt mij om van de sigaretten af ​​te blijven!</p>",
        "text_InBbd7XkgR92lYWX": "<p>Lio is een uitstekende vervanging. Ik was mijn diffuser kwijt, maar ze stuurden snel een vervanging - geweldig product en service!</p>",
        "text_CWoK5kP6NYZYrcb6": "<p>Josje (4 dagen geleden)</p>",
        "text_Ol40FqPkcJ7UmJNS": "<p>Geweldige, snelle service!</p>",
        "text_S0sMzpQ1RrYAPKVO": "<p>Kreeg snelle en vriendelijke hulp toen mijn pakket beschadigd aankwam. Het probleem werd vlot opgelost—uitstekende klantenservice!</p>",
        "text_El2K676Kn0zwjOy2": "<p>Stefan Blokzijl (1 dag geleden)</p>",
        "text_gsGXu4Gzf38V91NQ": "<p>Lio heeft mijn leven gered</p>",
        "text_VwwUvjWbmmt7kXvv": "<p>Ik rookte bijna 60 sigaretten per dag. Ik heb veel dure manieren geprobeerd om te stoppen met roken, maar helaas zonder resultaat. Ik besloot Lio te proberen en na 2 weken gebruik ik alleen dit. Zonder angstcrisis.</p>",
        "text_moUVoxTOoAYlGGMA": "<p>Pedro (11 Nov 2024)</p>",
        "text_INi0CO5wb0E0azMl": "<p>Ik ben eindelijk gestopt!</p>",
        "text_0MtphL2aJPKCGFye": "<p><em>Ik hou van mijn Lio! Zo blij dat ik eindelijk van de damp af ben na jaren en jaren. Zou het zeker aanraden.</em></p>",
        "text_nQPOB8lYqfsMgdfL": "<p>Bridgett (10 Nov 2024)</p>",
        "text_aXeUpzC3OThefeqm": "<h3><strong>JIJ VROEG</strong></h3>",
        "text_yrj0UhYXHVwzdTNr": "<h3><strong>wij antwoorden</strong></h3>",
        "text_gngl0vjaKMkegaZe": "<p><strong>What does flavored air taste like?</strong></p>",
        "text_yI83v1N3oqa5QOQP": "<p><strong>If you’re used to vapor, Lio might feel lighter at first—but it’s designed for a healthier future. Think of Lio as herbal tea compared to the sticky soda of vapor: less intense, more natural, and far better for you.</strong></p>",
        "text_usNJgGEkFftgJKyD": "<p>Is Lio safe to use?</p>",
        "text_Qo1QlikVQU9MPldx": "<p><strong>Lio is made with 100% natural ingredients and is completely free from nicotine, smoke, and harmful chemicals, making it a safe and healthier alternative for people trying to quit smoking or vaping.</strong></p>",
        "text_YcTesLna3PGpB2j5": "<p>How does Lio work?</p>",
        "text_jCUp8QZKVtZwIMXf": "<p><strong>Lio works by replacing the hand-to-mouth fixation with naturally infused air, offering calming, refreshing flavors without nicotine, smoke, or chemicals. This action helps reduce the psychological need for smoking or vaping while keeping you engaged with familiar habits.</strong></p>",
        "text_s2rhgPWGx7KfQPdZ": "<p>How long do the Lio Cores last?</p>",
        "text_gWR85OJ2G56WHjMz": "<p><strong>Each Lio Core lasts 2-4 days, depending on your usage. Heavy users may need to replace the cores more frequently, but they are designed to provide lasting flavor and a satisfying experience.</strong></p>",
        "text_aTPo4hAsLQIqs8G0": "<p>Shipping & Refunds</p>",
        "text_EZvAChRlpPBvojAo": "<p><strong>Worldwide shipping - For Free</strong></p><p>We ship worldwide from the Netherlands with free shipping on all orders. Delivery takes 2-3 days within Europe, 4-8 days outside Europe, and next-day delivery in the Middle East (from Dubai).</p><p></p><p><strong>The Money Back Guarantee</strong></p><p>If you’ve used Lio™, commit to a 30 days to experience its benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you’re not satisfied. This ensures you have enough time to fully explore its impact before making a decision.</p>",
        "text_cLc5kXVY2SeZ9uPZ": "<p>Can I use Lio anywhere?</p>",
        "text_4JGxyCUyhCxU9ton": "<p><strong>Yes! Lio produces no smoke, vapor, or harmful chemicals, so it can be used in most places where smoking or vaping are not allowed. Its discreet and clean design makes it a convenient, portable option to carry and use anywhere, whether you’re at home, work, or on the go.</strong></p>",
        "text_SrvpTADgKiIlgK4C": "<p>What are cores made of?</p>",
        "text_1eH5grFhPFIkhbkl": "<p>Each Core fiber is medical grade polyester, infused in the fiber is our unique plant blend of pure essential oils from amazing farms we've partnered with around the world.</p>",
        "text_Kxqy4aUWYkYcOwlX": "<p>How often can I use Lio?</p>",
        "text_a8RitR9ig8kuu0SS": "<p><strong>Use Lio as often as you like. If you experience any discomfort, please discontinue use and consult your physician.</strong></p>",
